[PrintTextModified Text:不好意思打扰了……|#0101Adv22_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:夜晚的医务室静悄悄的。<br>艾玛也自然地压低了音量，走进房间里。|#0101Adv22_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走到安安的床边时，<br>感觉到床上有人正爬起身的动静。|#0101Adv22_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，安安，我是不是把你吵醒了？|#0101Adv22_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-
[PrintTextModified Text:『你有什么事』|#0101Adv22_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，今天白天蕾雅不是来看望你了吗？<br>那时她好像错拿了你的手机。|#0101Adv22_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以她想让我把手机还你。<br>——呐，给你。|#0101Adv22_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛刚伸出手，安安就一下子把手机抢了过去。<br>艾玛不禁苦笑了一下。|#0101Adv22_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她这是讨厌我一个人呢，还是对所有人<br>　都是这副态度呢……）|#0101Adv22_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那我先回去咯。|#0101Adv22_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:做完要做的事，<br>艾玛便回过头来准备离开。|#0101Adv22_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，安安的手机里<br>传出一阵吵吵闹闹的声音。|#0101Adv22_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那好像是可可的声音。|#0101Adv22_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，直播开始了。<br>我也要看一下才行。|#0101Adv22_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:安安注意到了艾玛有些焦急的神情，<br>于是伸手向她递出了自己的手机。|#0101Adv22_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（她的意思是，想让我陪她一起看完再走？）|#0101Adv22_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然我想回自己房间看啦……<br>　不过安安竟然对我展现了善意，<br>　这是个难得的机会）|#0101Adv22_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你，那我就和你一起看咯。|#0101Adv22_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小心翼翼地坐在床边，<br>把视线移到安安的手机上。|#0101Adv22_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

