[PrintTextModified Text:画面上出现了<br>3名少女。|#0101Adv22_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_18_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_18_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:呀吼～我是可可碳～！|#0101Adv22_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:今天我们竟然！迎来了！<br>那位知名艺人莲见蕾雅，一起开联动台～！|#0101Adv22_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:哈哈，你今天好兴奋啊。|#0101Adv22_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:请问……为什么要把大叔我喊来呢……|#0101Adv22_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你就是单纯用来暖场的！你就是个龙套！|#0101Adv22_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:龙套……|#0101Adv22_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:说来“大叔”又是演哪一出啦！<br>你怎么看都是辣妹吧！|#0101Adv22_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Flushed1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:不对，那个，大叔就是大叔啊……<br>我不是很习惯这种场面，你不要老是跟我说话啦……|#0101Adv22_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:那你是来做什么的啊！！|#0101Adv22_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不禁笑出了声。<br>看样子，她们应该是在会客厅直播的。|#0101Adv22_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:同时在线观众只有6人。|#0101Adv22_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（在线观众才这么点，真佩服可可还能这么兴奋）|#0101Adv22_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:结果，全程亢奋的可可<br>竟想到让蕾雅表演杂技。|#0101Adv22_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:接下来，我要把这颗苹果丢出去，<br>而蕾雅就会用刺剑戳中它～！|#0101Adv22_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1,ArmR4,ArmL6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？等一下，我可没听说过要表演这个？|#0101Adv22_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:有什么不好的啦！肯定能炒热气氛的！|#0101Adv22_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:炒热什么气氛啊……看直播的才几个人……|#0101Adv22_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:龙套就给我闭嘴！|#0101Adv22_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅推脱不掉可可的恳求，最终还是表演了<br>用刺剑戳中抛出苹果的杂技。|#0101Adv22_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL8 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:真不愧是蕾雅，<br>她轻易地就表演成功了。|#0101Adv22_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

