; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:今天就到此为止了。<br>各位晚安。|#0101Adv22_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:记得再来看哦～！请多多转发推介！|#0101Adv22_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:工作人员之后会好好品尝这颗苹果，<br>我就把它好好收起来咯～……|#0101Adv22_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

