[PrintTextModified Text:三人挥起手来，然后直播直接断掉，<br>画面一下子变黑了。|#0101Adv22_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……好了，我也要回房间了！|#0101Adv22_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，谢谢你给我看手机！<br>晚安！|#0101Adv22_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:如果超时未回到房间，<br>就会违反规定。|#0101Adv22_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是艾玛急匆匆地离开了医务室。|#0101Adv22_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

